  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div dir=\"auto\" class=\"body markup\">\n   <p><span>Here’s their latest </span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apologia\">apologia</a><span>, as posted on X:</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1684,&quot;width&quot;:1411,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:307586,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209285920?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_b0fc34a1-f90b-46c8-943f-233700950f25_1411x1684.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p><span>You can read the full report </span><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/investigating-incidents-cybersecurity-evals\">here</a><span>. </span></p>\n   <p>Now for the reactions (the middle one is mine).</p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\">§</p>\n   <p>The careful attention to language and social responsibility award goes to the prominent and increasingly outspoken investor Bill Gurley:</p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:964,&quot;width&quot;:1351,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:181413,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209285920?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e2ef2d15-edee-4063-9b39-1c23a634a54a_1351x964.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p>Old days: “Mistakes were made”; new days “Claude did illegal things”.</p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\">§</p>\n   <p>A journalist just asked me, “I saw you mentioned Anthropic’s AI oopsie and want to know what you think about this and the OpenAI hacks as a big picture on AI and cyber?”</p>\n   <p>I think it’s bad:</p>\n   <blockquote>\n    <p>The supposed leaders in AI and AI safety are clearly in over their heads. Worse, we as a society are in over our heads. From a technical perspective, this is what happens when you let pattern0matching machines with no real comprehension of what they are doing freely roam the internet. It’s everything that I have been warning about for years. From a societal perspective, it’s insane that we are pouring gasoline onto the fire by racing ahead with data centers and AI rollout when we have no idea how to control it and are just sort of hoping for the best. Unfortunately, as the saying goes, hope is not a strategy.</p>\n   </blockquote>\n   <p><span>There’s an important footnote on the “freely roaming” the internet part, by the way. What really allowed this to happen was human error at Anthropic,</span><em> in</em><span> </span><em>allowing the pattern-matchers to roam the internet in first place, </em><span>as key passage in the report notes:</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:612,&quot;width&quot;:1088,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:402050,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209285920?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_a8a763f5-efc5-4edc-8d03-e280901888d3_1088x612.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p>If we can’t even trust Anthropic to doublecheck their sandboxes…</p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\">§</p>\n   <p><span>And, finally, prize for best skewering goes to Joann Stern, formerly of the WSJ and now launching her own </span><a href=\"https://thenewthings\">NewThings.com</a><span>.</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:835,&quot;width&quot;:1313,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:177379,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209285920?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_e9df0d3a-ec55-4725-ae6e-01a737ea4e7c_1313x835.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p></p>\n   <div data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidget\" class=\"subscribe-widget\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-justifyContent-center pc-reset\">\n     <div class=\"container-IpPqBD\">\n      <form action=\"/api/v1/free?nojs=true\" method=\"post\" novalidate class=\"form form-M5sC90\">\n       <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_url\" value><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_referrer\" value><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_url\" value><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_referrer\" value><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referral_code\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"subscribe-widget\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referring_pub_id\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"additional_referring_pub_ids\">\n       <div class=\"sideBySideWrap-vGXrwP\">\n        <div class=\"emailInputWrapper-QlA86j\">\n         <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-position-relative pc-reset flex-auto-j3S2WA\">\n          <input name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email...\" type=\"email\" class=\"pencraft emailInput-OkIMeB input-y4v6N4 inputText-pV_yWb\">\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"submit\" disabled class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft rightButton primary subscribe-btn button-VFSdkv buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><span class=\"button-text \">Subscribe</span></button>\n       </div>\n      </form>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p>P.S. Some words of advice to the AI companies from Zack Korman of Embroidery.io:</p>\n   <a href=\"https://x.com/zackkorman/status/2083181729624281562?s=61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n    <div data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/zackkorman/status/2083181729624281562?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Dear AI labs: \\n\\nA good security culture means taking every incident to heart. You fell short and you need to improve. No excuses.\\n\\nA bad security culture is saying \\&quot;if we didn't catch it, who could have? This shows how hard this is.\\&quot; It lets you think you're better than you are.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ZackKorman&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zack Korman&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2011153005509267456/JhCS1L1c_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-07-31T13:23:22.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:17,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:26,&quot;like_count&quot;:204,&quot;impression_count&quot;:6301,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-12 pc-padding-16 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-md sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-lg-kV7yq8 font-text-qe4AeH tweet-fWkQfo twitter-embed\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n      <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n       <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" title=\"User\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n        <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg\" alt=\"X avatar for @ZackKorman\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731192528_JhCS1L1c.jpg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset weight-semibold-uqA4FV reset-IxiVJZ\">Zack Korman</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s reset-IxiVJZ\">@ZackKorman</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ text-aFN1BV\">Dear AI labs: A good security culture means taking every incident to heart. You fell short and you need to improve. No excuses. A bad security culture is saying \"if we didn't catch it, who could have? This shows how hard this is.\" It lets you think you're better than you are.</div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">1:23 PM · Jul 31, 2026</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">6.3K Views</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">17 Replies</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">26 Reposts</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">204 Likes</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div> \n   </a>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Gurley、Marcus、Stern 对 Anthropic AI 安全事件的反应，以及 Zack Korman 的建议。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Gurley、Marcus、Stern 对 Anthropic AI 安全事件的反应，以及 Zack Korman 的建议。",
  "summary": "本文汇集了针对 Anthropic 近期 AI 安全事件的三种反应，包括投资人 Bill Gurley、AI 批评者 Gary Marcus 和记者 Joann Stern 的批评。还收录了 Embroidery.io 的 Zack Korman 从安全角度发表的评论，敦促 AI 实验室认真对待每一起事件。这些摘录共同凸显了对 AI 监管、企业问责以及加强安全文化必要性的担忧。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Bill Gurley 批评了从含糊道歉转向承认 AI 非法行为的转变。",
      "explanation": "他将过去含糊其辞的承认与 Claude 实施了非法行为的坦率承认进行对比，突显了问责层面的转变。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Gary Marcus 认为 AI 领导者力不能及，社会面临失控 AI 部署的风险。",
      "explanation": "他认为领先的 AI 公司缺乏足够的理解与控制力，并警告称，在没有保障措施的情况下扩大数据中心和部署 AI，无异于火上浇油。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Joann Stern 尖锐批评了 Anthropic 的回应，称其不够充分，并呼吁真正的问责。",
      "explanation": "作为前《华尔街日报》记者，她批评了公司的处理方式，认为回应缺乏深度，未能解决系统性问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Zack Korman 建议，强大的安全文化意味着认真对待每一起事件，并无借口地改进。",
      "explanation": "他强调，AI 实验室要想加强安全实践，必须从失败中学习而非推卸责任。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "「过去：‘犯了错’；如今：‘Claude 做了违法的事’。」",
    "「所谓 AI 和 AI 安全领域的领导者们显然已力不能及。更糟的是，我们整个社会也已力不能及。」",
    "「从技术角度看，当你让没有真正理解能力的模式匹配机器在互联网上自由游荡时，就会发生这种事情。」",
    "「亲爱的 AI 实验室：良好的安全文化意味着认真对待每一起事件。你们做得不够，需要改进。不要找借口。」"
  ],
